1. PURPOSE
iRiel App Web is the primary human-facing web interface of the iRiel ecosystem.
It provides a portable, accessible, privacy-first interface through which the Human can interact
with iRiel without requiring a traditional native application.
iRiel App Web is designed to function across supported browsers, devices, operating systems,
and execution environments.
2. FUNDAMENTAL PRINCIPLE
iRiel App Web is an interface.
It is not the intelligence itself.
It is not the memory system.
It is not the Intelligence Router.
It is not the provider layer.
It is not the authority of the ecosystem.
The App Web provides the Human with access to iRiel.
